There is a chance that once transfer will be completed a new one will come. In that case, if in interrupt we overwrite length (*lock = 1).  Maybe we should lock immediately in while loop which is doing the check? Something like:
```
do {
  while(txbuf) {  uarte_nrfx_isr_async(dev); }
} while (atomic_cas(&lock, 0, 1) == false);
```
